      "statement": "The look-ahead audit parses strategy source with Python's ast module and flags forecast-named calls, negative pandas shifts, and positive integer feed indexing outright, while flagging negative subscripts only for manual review because they are safe in backtrader and unsafe in pandas and the audit cannot resolve the calling context.",
