      "id": "claim_d562c52968e54b97b0bec5e746b771d9",
      "statement": "FDR and FWER are documented as the frame for the library-screening question rather than as the binding gate: the per-strategy DSR is the binding control because it already encodes multiple testing through the N-trial deflation.",
