    {
      "id": "claim_ed19e368ce984bc49ff209b6fda8eab2",
      "statement": "Two disclosure rules are described as architectural rather than optional: paper-claim deltas are surfaced on every passport rather than collapsed into an aggregate score, and price-based proxies are disclosed in the strategy file where the implementation diverges from the paper's universe or data.",
